
> opint@1.0.0 start
> dt-app run

════════

Dynatrace App Toolkit - Command line tool to develop Dynatrace Apps

Options:
  -h, --help                        Show help page for the command.
  --no-color                        Terminal output renders without color.
  --non-interactive                 Run in non-interactive mode. Throws error
                                    when a required command option or argument
                                    is missing.

Commands:
  action|a                          Dynatrace Workflows actions
  analyze|an [options]              Analyze app to check for valid app
                                    configurations, security issues and bundle
                                    statistics.
  build|b [options]                 Build the app and analyze the bundle.
  create|c [options] [name]         Create a new Dynatrace App.
  deploy|de [options]               Build and deploy your app to a configured
                                    Dynatrace environment.
  dev|d [options]                   Start the development server.
  function|f                        Dynatrace App functions
  help [command]                    display help for command
  info|i [options]                  Output detailed information about the App
                                    Toolkit and the environment.
  migration|m                       Package update migrations
  uninstall|un [options]            Uninstall the app from the specified
                                    environment.
  update|u [options] [packages...]  Update @dynatrace-scoped packages and the
                                    App Toolkit to the latest version and apply
                                    automatic migrations.
  version|v [options]               Print the version of the App Toolkit.

════════

